进程等待
	pid_t wait(int *status);//表示等待任意子进程的退出
	参数：表示子进程退出状态

	pid_t waitpid(pid_t pid, int *status, int options);

	< -1   meaning wait for any child process whose process group
	ID is equal to the absolute value of pid.
			等待指定进程组绝对值的任意子进程
	-1     meaning wait for any child process.
			等待任意一个子进程
	0      meaning wait for any child process whose process group
	ID is equal to that of the calling process.
			等待同一个组（父进程一致）中的任意子进程
	> 0    meaning wait for the child whose process ID  is  equal
	to the value of pid.
			指定等待进程号是pid的进程

	option : 表示标志位
		0 : 阻塞
		WNOWAIT ： 取消阻塞

